T* () Tj
T* (03. DISQUALIFICATION CRITERIA : Candidature shall be declared Disqualified if any of the following criteria is violated during HOME CBT ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (              A\)        Candidates are not allowed to leave their room or table for any purpose during the entire duration of test. Hence he/ she is ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (                          advised to prepare themselves before hand. Any picture which finds you missing from desk shall be a cause for disqualification.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (              B\)        Candidates found talking or taking phone calls or with another mobile in hand) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (              C\)        Visibility of any other person in the room or around the candidates during the test duration.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (              D\)        Candidates who try to minimize the browser or open another tab shall be warned and their test will be automatically logged out ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (                          and treated as malpractice. Hence please ensure all pop-ups / notifications/ sms / whatsapp messages are blocked temporarily.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (              E\)        Switching off / hiding the camera / microphone during the course of exam) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (              F\)        The software records any effort to take Screenshots / Print screens and shall be a cause for disqualification of candidate.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (              G\)        Attempt to Multiple Logins from different devices will lock the exam or lead to rejection) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (04. Do not close the exam window or browser or else your test will be submitted automatically.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (05. In case you get logged out abruptly from device, try to re-login or else  please call/ e mail helpdesk. Do not try to do any other activity on your  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (      PC/laptop/Android phone during the examination period.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (06. Once you complete the test, then Press the “ SUBMIT BUTTON”, only after first 30 minutes of test.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (07. However,both the devices must have a Webcam or Mobile Phone with Front Camera. In case you have any issues from Desktop/Laptop/Mobile ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (      phone, you may logout and switch to other device immediately, if desired. But, multiple logins are not allowed and will get logged out unsaved.) Tj
